-- **Full run**: changes to the shared runner and harness (`z-nile/tests/run.luau`, `z-nile/tests/lib`), z-nile's libraries (`z-nile/lib/`), `./zn`, the root's `scripts/` or a root config file (`.luaurc`, `rokit.toml`, `selene.toml`, `stylua.toml`) force one of every project; a change to a project's own `tests/lib`, `tests/run.luau`, `tests/meta`, `scripts/`, `.luaurc` or `default.project.json` (under its home) forces that project's, and any other change under `z-nile/` (the engine, the gate) z-nile's. A change at an old place (the root's `tests/`, `tracker/`, `src/`, the root's project files) forces z-nile's, whose old-roots check then fails. `lune run z-nile/affected -- --project <name>` prints one project's selection, relative to its home.
